Package: meancontest
Type: Package
Title: Robust Constrained Gaussian Mean Hypothesis Testing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yikun", "Li", email = "YikunLi2028@u.northwestern.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R counterpart of the mean-contest Python implementation of
    robust signal detection with quadratically convex orthosymmetric mean
    constraints. Provides the constrained testing interface, optimal dimension
    utilities, and the original four filtering and testing steps. Implements
    the source package's formulas and thresholds without replacing them with
    alternate versions of the paper's algorithms.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/TomLee0122/Mean_ConTest_R,
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.13036
BugReports: https://github.com/TomLee0122/Mean_ConTest_R/issues
